@startuml
actor Admin
participant "Admin Panel" as Panel
participant "API Sunucusu" as API
database "MongoDB" as DB
participant "Bildirim Servisi" as Notify

Admin -> Panel : Bekleyen icerikleri acar
Panel -> API : GET /moderation/pending
API -> DB : Bekleyen ilan/urun/basvuru sorgusu
DB --> API : Liste
API --> Panel : Moderasyon kuyrugu
Admin -> Panel : Onay / Red karari verir
Panel -> API : PATCH /moderation/{id}
API -> DB : Karar, gerekce ve denetim kaydi yaz
API -> Notify : Ilgili kullaniciya bildirim gonder
Notify --> API : Bildirim sonucu
API --> Panel : Islem sonucu
Panel --> Admin : Durum guncellendi
@enduml
